BT 1 0 0 1 4 138.8 Tm /F5 8.2 Tf 10.5 TL (public List<List<Integer>> subsets\(int[] nums\) {) Tj T* (    List<List<Integer>> result = new ArrayList<>\(\);) Tj T* (    backtrack\(nums, 0, new ArrayList<>\(\), result\);) Tj T* (    return result;) Tj T* (}) Tj T*  T* (private void backtrack\(int[] nums, int start, List<Integer> current, List<List<Integer>> result\) {) Tj T* (    result.add\(new ArrayList<>\(current\)\); // every state along the way is a valid subset) Tj T* (    for \(int i = start; i < nums.length; i++\) {) Tj T* (        current.add\(nums[i]\);       // choose) Tj T* (        backtrack\(nums, i + 1, current, result\); // explore) Tj T* (        current.remove\(current.size\(\) - 1\);      // un-choose \(backtrack\)) Tj T* (    }) Tj T* (}) Tj T* ET
